# Noty Linux — third-party notices

Noty Linux is a Linux desktop project written in Qt 6, QML and C++. KDE Plasma
6 is the first shipping desktop integration.

The bundled action icons are [Phosphor Icons](https://phosphoricons.com/) in
the Regular weight. Their MIT license is included in
[`licenses/PHOSPHOR-MIT.txt`](licenses/PHOSPHOR-MIT.txt).

The landing page self-hosts Noto Serif under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.
Its complete license text is included in
[`licenses/NOTO-OFL.txt`](licenses/NOTO-OFL.txt).
